## Use it like this

- Use only glossary terms, verbatim, in requirements, BR and AC; a word under "Avoid saying" is a defect.
- A new or fuzzy word (not in the glossary, or meaning two things): name the candidate terms and ask which one; check claims about behavior against the code ([01]({{ref_01}})).
- Before a spec question about status, read the entity card: ask about every transition the change touches.
- Before any rule about who sees or changes data, read the roles × scopes matrix.
- When a work item changes an entity, role or rule, update this skill in the same item.

## Labels

`VERIFIED` = read from the code (path given) · `CONFIRMED` = stated by the user or an approved document · `OPEN` = not known yet — ask it, never assume it.

